# RECORD_4

> COLLECTION: YC Requests for Startups (Fall 2026)
> DATE: July 26, 2026

## PAYLOAD
Multiplayer AI
> Concept: A real-time collaborative workspace and execution canvas for long-running AI agent tasks.

> Core Problem: Current AI interfaces are isolated and single-user, only allowing team members to review static, read-only transcripts after an agent completes or fails a workflow.

> Solution: Offer shareable URL control rooms where multiple team members can view agent execution in real time, pause or correct agent direction mid-flight, and hand off operational control smoothly across teams.
